WEBVTT

01:05:34.880 --> 01:05:37.340
Houston, do we have
permission to launch?

01:05:38.217 --> 01:05:39.926
Roger. Permission granted.

01:05:40.011 --> 01:05:44.139
You are confirmed
at "T" minus ten seconds.

01:05:44.223 --> 01:05:47.976
And counting.
Ten, nine,

01:05:48.060 --> 01:05:50.812
eight, seven, six,

01:05:50.896 --> 01:05:54.024
five, four, three, two,

01:05:54.108 --> 01:05:58.236
-one!
-Reach for the sky!

01:05:59.655 --> 01:06:03.116
This town ain't big enough
for the two of us.
